! TDDFT mode matrix 07/16 -- range-separated hybrid  (wB97X-D)
!
! The only case that builds the erf-attenuated MO blocks OVOV_X /
! OOVV_X (v0.88.2) on top of the full-range ones, and the only one
! whose memory forecast takes the phase-3 branch.  For wB97X-D the
! short-range fraction is nonzero AND rs_beta > 0, so both weights
! are exercised.
!
! Also covers the v1.13.1 clean-room CHG dispersion tail riding along
! in the ground state.
%method  WB97X-D
%basis   sto-3g
%job     energy
%charge  0
%mult    1
%tddft   3
%tddft_multiplicity singlet
%geom angstrom
O    0.000000    0.000000    0.117300
H    0.000000    0.757200   -0.469200
H    0.000000   -0.757200   -0.469200
*end
